theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "Left: select (drag: box, Shift: add, Ctrl/Cmd or double click: same kind)   Right: order (hold: radial menu)
A / G / M: arm attack / guard / move, then left click   R: retreat to the hero   Alt+1..8: formation   Tab (hold): radial menu at the pointer
Ctrl/Cmd+1..0: store a group   1..0: recall   Shift+1..0: add to it
Arrows / screen edges / middle drag: pan   Q / E: turn   Wheel: zoom   F: follow the hero / free camera"

